": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4ji_xaGQJwgQ7kNvwGSeb50&_nc_oc=Adq2b2dSA9TzVrox9NB0BuBZeVdF-nt9QmwxuKARkgiQXqlptRyqg-TC2pp84wRDRYg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQENhoVRwPRvHyS52vSe3e56RWbOk2swcfLlV_ZpK1wOcA&oe=6A844ADB"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kZQPPdRLzRQQ7kNvwF_MUdy&_nc_oc=AdpS6x6N4URyopypWJhUUwycS54THVGjJ8kX8l8S2aCgYKJjJUPeo7JqeWjKqYzla8M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG-tU-PB6FglSmmesU5aS2ALxTRkhQ_X8mlLQKw9W8hPQ&oe=6A843B21"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uso5YjymJg8Q7kNvwFEZhUS&_nc_oc=AdqNLVptvPSMiieJkAxD1_Kxr6R0_mg-3g76d1ezd4Pm22LzjqAj7iAfNt6w0SbMapM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGC0LykE6xnrcFHrBXJhsa2DuNcgcC7M-XdSYZp0K29hg&oe=6A84602F"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rmSO_Bno1xIQ7kNvwFw_h6K&_nc_oc=AdoafL9LD0QC4F8PRoqxR9tep-WC1mgANSRdwZT2bQkAGNWjPJSp4thKvWKWnXlzynU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF9uckC5HvxHQPpwqWzWi-fr5Zix71X1ocChd4s1iE3ew&oe=6A845FD2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MCldGJkzR04Q7kNvwGcERnw&_nc_oc=AdqcrhSDktNP6lgVQAPMmxEskWuL6gLhl4PZZP3MrGwsoOF5ScVv5KDPeBnFfzpj4v0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG9ojEehHmiYrf7Y2s23BcgMxgZBFsKixX4zJYv9rDctg&oe=6A84313D"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a